For geocoding the street address to coordinates, **bing-maps-locations, bing-maps-search, google-maps-geocoding** or **mapquest-geocoding** would be suitable.

For rendering the map with points, either static map APIs (Google Static Maps or Bing Static Maps), or embeddable JavaScript maps like OpenLayers or Scribble Maps.

